{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108602","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108602/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108602/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108602/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108602","id":3228521247,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7Ab1Mf","number":108602,"title":"2xMSAA causes artifacts when using the Vulkan renderer with AMD Windows drivers (Issue not present in D3D)","user":{"login":"InitialCon","id":66960524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2OTYwNTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66960524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/InitialCon","html_url":"https://github.com/InitialCon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InitialCon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InitialCon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InitialCon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InitialCon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InitialCon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InitialCon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InitialCon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InitialCon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InitialCon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-07-14T12:03:38Z","updated_at":"2025-11-20T11:21:49Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nIssue discovered in 4.5 Beta 3 but reproducible all the way back to 4.0.\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Vulkan API 1.4.308 - Forward+ - Using Vulkan Device #0: AMD - AMD Radeon RX 6800 (Driver 25.6.1)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen enabling 2xMSAA, the following effects break and exhibit artifacts: SSR, SSAO, SSIL, and SDFGI. The artifacts disappear when switching to any other MSAA mode, such as disabled, 4x, or 8x. Screenshots are included below to demonstrate the artifacts. Please note that intensity has been increased to make the effect more obvious.\n\n- SSIL:\nEnabled:\n<img width=\"1354\" height=\"893\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c54e775d-3fb8-4bbe-9923-3b0fa01ce37c\" />\n\nDisabled:\n<img width=\"1357\" height=\"888\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6210d226-ee25-466c-9231-abe533d03c53\" />\n\n- SSAO:\nEnabled:\n<img width=\"1349\" height=\"892\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b61d4548-1766-4bdc-b25a-3990bd18b350\" />\n\nDisabled:\n<img width=\"1351\" height=\"896\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa71026e-a183-43b2-ae28-ae299e5c05d4\" />\n\n- SSR:\nEnabled:\n<img width=\"1350\" height=\"899\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1565d901-0480-4e79-8a22-e3e2934209b8\" />\n\nDisabled:\n<img width=\"1349\" height=\"901\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e1d629c8-0da6-4959-b72a-ed9ae971ce79\" />\n\n- SDFGI:\nEnabled:\n<img width=\"1348\" height=\"900\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f363a268-364e-473b-88cd-a9f45253a8bc\" />\n\nDisabled:\n<img width=\"1349\" height=\"898\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d510cfe2-5156-43c7-9342-5e91872583ec\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nEnable 2xMSAA in project settings and then enable either SSAO, SSIl, SSR, SDFGI, or a combination of the four.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21215427/mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108602/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108602/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}